#### General Features of Plugin #####

As stated earlier, I am only providing sample files. However, all features stated in this file are current implemented, working features. 

Player -> Join -> PlayerJoinEvents -> PlayerQuitEvents
Player -> Command -> PartyManager -> Party Data
Player -> PlayerInteractEvent -> Cosmetic Menu -> Nightbox
Player -> Chat Hover Over Event -> Get Host to choose minigame -> Play minigame

The full plugin itself contains:

Main:
Join/Quit Messages, Ranks, Coins, Leveling System, Spawn Items such as a game selector, custom tab and scoreboard, cosmetics, and prefences. 

Cosmetics:
Nightboxes to obtain cosmetics, morphs, gadgets, pets, outfits, and particles. Cosmetics can also evolve when you have 5 shards, you may spin to evolve a random one, an evolved cosmetic is a more crazy version of your current one. You are able to ride your pets.

